Author: Artem Lavrukhin <lavryha4590@gmail.com>
Description: Keep ReactOS shell hosts in the private shell assembly.
 Resolve bare shell-host launches beside the loaded shell32 and remove
 inactive COM registration resources from shell32.
Last-Modified: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 15:00:00 +0300

--- a/src/dll/win32/shell32/rgs_res.rc
